{"2553580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Go Marbles!", "steam_appid": 2553580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and play your own marble runs using an intuitive block based editor.  Publish your creations to the Steam Workshop and let others attempt to complete your run in record time.  Each of your creations has it's own Steam Leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 70 track types and contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block based level editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share your own levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gameplay mechanics: jump, brake, cling, swap, boost, gravity and more...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six camera modes from fixed to first person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: timed checkpoint run, tilt only puzzles and sandbox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics requiring fast reflex skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time for practice runs or relaxed gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add triggers to move, rotate and destroy track components as you race against the clock.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and play your own marble runs using an intuitive block based editor.  Publish your creations to the Steam Workshop and let others attempt to complete your run in record time.  Each of your creations has it's own Steam Leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 70 track types and contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block based level editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share your own levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gameplay mechanics: jump, brake, cling, swap, boost, gravity and more...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six camera modes from fixed to first person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: timed checkpoint run, tilt only puzzles and sandbox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics requiring fast reflex skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet time for practice runs or relaxed gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add triggers to move, rotate and destroy track components as you race against the clock.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Complete high speed marble runs in the fastest time.  Physics based jump mechanics provides a unique, realistic and challenging parkour game experience.  Create, share and compete in your own marble run adventures using the intuitive block based editor.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553580/header.jpg?t=1734389168", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553580/1ca528a2c6b707b0cfd732750748e58f7c670294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734389168", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553580/1ca528a2c6b707b0cfd732750748e58f7c670294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734389168", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements